.superpowers/
!.env.example

# private session notes
SESSION_LOG.md
HANDOFF.md

# Public repo shows judges only what they need: README.md is the only markdown.
# Internal notes (Devpost draft, demo script, ADRs, plans, teammate briefs) stay local.
*.md
!/README.md
.claude/

# Unused Next.js boilerplate and self-host files (we deploy on Vercel)
public/file.svg
public/globe.svg
public/next.svg
public/vercel.svg
public/window.svg
Dockerfile
Caddyfile
docker-compose.yml
